Z||000000||GT Bastard||01-25-2000||11:12 PM||||Hey Darklord, I was browsing <A HREF="http://www.fieroproject.com" TARGET=_blank>www.fieroproject.com</A>  and notice a car like mine on your website...  Then I noticed the bottom of the garages in my apartment complex in the background... Then, I noticed the white licence plate with the red sticker in the upper right corner...Then, I realized that picture is identical to the one I took of MY fiero at: <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/carbonatedjeff" TARGET=_blank>www.geocities.com/carbonatedjeff</A>  <BR>Man, you shoulda told me!  I'm flattered somebody actually put me on their website.<BR>Nice cropping job, btw.... I got a little too much of the background in the origional.<P>peace!<P>-GT Bastard<P><BR>||||reg||1
